gesto"],["new neighbor","vizinho novo"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A blog post","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"Diary: Making Friends in a New City","paras":["I **made** a decision: I would **make** an effort to meet people. First I **made** a list of clubs. Then I **made** a phone call and **made** an appointment.","Last night, Carla **made me laugh**. **That makes sense**: friendship **makes** a city feel like home."],"kicker":"BLOG","by":"Sofia, new in town","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Sofia made a decision to meet people.","ans":"T","why":"made a decision."},{"q":"Carla made her cry.","ans":"F","why":"laugh."},{"q":"Friendship makes a city feel like home.","ans":"T","why":"like home."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“make an effort” = ?","opts":["esforçar-se","fazer esforço físico","fabricar força"],"ans":0,"why":"make an effort."},{"q":"“appointment” = ?","opts":["compromisso marcado","apontamento","aposentadoria"],"ans":0,"why":"appointment."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Key verb: make","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Uso","Exemplo"],"rows":[["make + substantivo","**make a decision / a list / a call**"],["make + alguém + verbo","**She made me laugh.**"],["make + adjetivo","**It makes me happy.**"],["That makes sense.","**Faz sentido.**"]],"cap":"Key verb: make"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**make** (criar/produzir) × **do** (atividade/tarefa): *make a cake*, *do homework*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"I ___ a decision. (make, past)","a":"made","why":"make-made."},{"s":"She ___ me laugh. (make, past)","a":"made","why":"make + obj + verbo."},{"s":"That ___ sense. (make)","a":"makes","why":"3ª pessoa."},{"s":"Let’s ___ an effort. (make)","a":"make","why":"make an effort."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the w